EmulateQPU-4Q

Copyright 2026 EmulateQPU rightsholder

This project includes original EmulateQPU software, including the finite-pulse
engine derived from emulateqpu-chain and its transmon kernel, the digital twin
chain conductor geometry and capacitance reduction, and the upstream EmulateQPU
product and field workflow adapters. Its native field overlap helper derives
from the EmulateQPU common-point MFEM overlap and exact-field evaluators.
This distribution adapts those parts for a standalone four-qubit workflow.

